<codeline lineno="35"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="36"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>display<sp/>transformation<sp/>matrix<sp/>specifies<sp/>an<sp/>affine<sp/>transformation<sp/>that</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="37"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>should<sp/>be<sp/>applied<sp/>to<sp/>video<sp/>frames<sp/>for<sp/>correct<sp/>presentation.<sp/>It<sp/>is<sp/>compatible</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="38"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>matrices<sp/>stored<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>ISO/IEC<sp/>14496-12<sp/>container<sp/>format.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="39"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="40"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>data<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>3x3<sp/>matrix<sp/>represented<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>9-element<sp/>array:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="41"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="42"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@code{.unparsed}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="43"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>a<sp/>b<sp/>u<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="44"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>(a,<sp/>b,<sp/>u,<sp/>c,<sp/>d,<sp/>v,<sp/>x,<sp/>y,<sp/>w)<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>|<sp/>c<sp/>d<sp/>v<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="45"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>x<sp/>y<sp/>w<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="46"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@endcode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="47"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="48"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>All<sp/>numbers<sp/>are<sp/>stored<sp/>in<sp/>native<sp/>endianness,<sp/>as<sp/>16.16<sp/>fixed-point<sp/>values,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="49"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>except<sp/>for<sp/>u,<sp/>v<sp/>and<sp/>w,<sp/>which<sp/>are<sp/>stored<sp/>as<sp/>2.30<sp/>fixed-point<sp/>values.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="50"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="51"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>transformation<sp/>maps<sp/>a<sp/>point<sp/>(p,<sp/>q)<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>source<sp/>(pre-transformation)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="52"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>frame<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>point<sp/>(p&apos;,<sp/>q&apos;)<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>destination<sp/>(post-transformation)<sp/>frame<sp/>as</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="53"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>follows:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="54"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="55"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@code{.unparsed}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="56"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>a<sp/>b<sp/>u<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="57"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>(p,<sp/>q,<sp/>1)<sp/>.<sp/>|<sp/>c<sp/>d<sp/>v<sp/>|<sp/>=<sp/>z<sp/>*<sp/>(p&apos;,<sp/>q&apos;,<sp/>1)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="58"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>x<sp/>y<sp/>w<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="59"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@endcode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="60"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="61"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>transformation<sp/>can<sp/>also<sp/>be<sp/>more<sp/>explicitly<sp/>written<sp/>in<sp/>components<sp/>as</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="62"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>follows:</highlight></codeline>
